OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident involves 'foreign
OL,4,Aactor', says Rubio
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio has
OL,7,Fsaid the suspected terror plot at RAF
OL,8,FFairford "clearly involves the hands of
OL,9,Fa foreign actor".
OL,11,FIn an interview with Fox News on
OL,12,FMonday, Rubio said "I think it ties us
OL,13,Fto the reality here, and that is we are
OL,14,Fdealing with elements in the world, and
OL,15,Fin the case of Iran, for example, who
OL,16,Fhave openly threatened to attack
OL,17,FAmerican interests globally".
OL,19,FHe did not provide evidence or further
OL,20,Fdetails. Tehran has strongly denied any
OL,21,Finvolvement.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/41
