OL,3,ATrump rules out joint US-China venture
OL,4,Ato develop AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing Chinese President Xi
OL,7,FJinping's visit to the White House last
OL,8,Fweek, Beijing and Washington announced
OL,9,Fthe launch of a new AI dialogue, with
OL,10,Ffurther talks scheduled for November.
OL,12,FThe two countries also established a
OL,13,Fnew communications channel to prevent
OL,14,Fmisunderstandings during AI-related
OL,15,Fincidents.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/41
